This directory is for the manuscript for Journal of Symbolic Computation.

To create hankin_jsc.pdf, first  use Sweave:

R CMD Sweave hankin_jsc.Rnw

this will create hankin_jsc.tex

To process this with latex, you will need various auxiliary files, not
under version control, to the inst/ directory:

* stokes.png, the hexsticker, copied from man/figures
* stokes.bib, copied from vignettes/
* Various style files such as cas-sc.cls, cas-common.sty, cas-model2-names.bst,
    from the JSC website
    
* You might need extra files in directories figs/ and thumbnails/


Then to create hankin_jsc.pdf:

latexmk hankin_jsc.tex

should work.
